OL,3,GNEWSALabour council leader ousted after
OL,4,Afour months
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaleem said: "Tonight's vote is deeply
OL,7,Fdisappointing. I want to thank the
OL,8,Fcouncillors and residents who have
OL,9,Freached out over the past couple of
OL,10,Fweeks to show their support for our
OL,11,FLabour Group."
